Modifications: the four upstream skills (game-feel, camera-systems,
input-systems and the feel half of physics-tuning) were merged into one skill
with three references (input.md, camera.md, juice.md) and rewritten in the
house style. Engine API (Godot and Unity code, node and property names, engine
versions) was removed and replaced with engine-neutral pseudocode and pointers
to the engine skills. From GodotPrompter camera-system, the trauma-shake model
and the eased look-ahead technique were taken; its frame-rate-dependent
lerp(k * delta) smoothing was replaced with 1 - exp(-rate * dt), and the
camera-roll pitfall (a 2D camera that ignores rotation by default) is called
out. Added: jump design from height and time to apex, corner correction,
inner and outer stick deadzones, the mouse-delta-times-dt pitfall, rebinding
safety rules, hit-stop variants and a review checklist.

